        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "几乎 + predicate",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "几乎 means almost or nearly. With a negative predicate it can mean hardly; identify which part is in its scope.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "人几乎都来了。",
                "pinyin": "rén jīhū dōu lái le 。",
                "meaning": "Almost everyone has arrived.",
                "audio": "cfd0a9695fee524fc6f125a44a7c8c16337f91378dc7c2759115c707303f8dd7"
              },
              {
                "text": "我几乎没睡觉。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ jīhū méi shuìjiào 。",
                "meaning": "I hardly slept.",
